{"id":"vosstanie","lemma":"восстание","pos":"noun","rank":4202,"glosses":["rebellion; revolt; insurgency (organized resistance against a political authority)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f3/Ru-%D0%B2%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5.ogg/Ru-%D0%B2%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"восстания","plural":"восстания"},"examples":[{"text":"Восстание было подавлено.","en":"The rebellion was suppressed.","words":[null,{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null]},{"text":"Мы были участниками восстания.","en":"We were rebels.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"were","l":"быть"},null,null]},{"text":"Восстание длилось около двух месяцев.","en":"The rebellion lasted about two months.","words":[null,{"g":"to last","l":"длиться"},{"g":"near"},{"g":"two","l":"два"},null]},{"text":"Его анализ причин восстания был верным.","en":"His analysis of the causes of the uprising was correct.","words":[{"g":"him / his"},{"g":"analysis"},null,null,{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null]},{"text":"Люди подняли восстание против короля.","en":"People rose in revolt against the king.","words":[{"g":"people, humans"},{"g":"to raise","l":"поднять"},null,{"g":"against"},{"g":"king","l":"король"}]}]}